    "steps": [
      "type_map: v0 entity_type -> v1 entity_type (identity unless the source renames it); a rename keeps the old entity_id as an alias and sets superseded_by on the old id.",
      "property_map: per type, v0 property -> v1 property; v1-required properties without a value set review_status=draft and status=candidate; unmapped v0 properties move to properties.legacy_v0.",
      "relationship_map: v0 relationship_type -> v1 type; a proposed-v0 type with no v1 counterpart becomes related_to when both ends are Concept, otherwise the relationship is kept unpublished with properties.legacy_relationship_type and sent to review.",
      "claims, evidence ids, document ids and review_status are never rewritten; edited_by_human records keep their values and conflicts are reported.",
      "dry_run first: write a migration report (counts, unmapped names, conflicts); apply is idempotent by (entity_type, canonical_key) and relationship_id."
    ],
